    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: With your sprite sheet now neatly sliced into individual images, you just need to create an animation file that controls how these frames will be animated in the scene.
--- !u!114 &-3334162598541523679
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
